    "detailed_description": "<h1>SEE ALSO</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;This Prologue lets you produce and trade with the limited version of Farming &amp; Supermarket Simulator. Complete your fun Farming &amp; Supermarket experience by adding the full game to your wishlist!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow, Harvest, Use</h2></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the best use of your harvested products: either fill the supermarket shelves or use them as feed for your animals. The choice is yours!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147710/extras/712613ddd0613d6588c7d221a2dcafdb.poster.avif?t=1749071241\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147710/extras/712613ddd0613d6588c7d221a2dcafdb.webm?t=1749071241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147710/extras/712613ddd0613d6588c7d221a2dcafdb.mp4?t=1749071241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> <br> </strong>Feed and Collect</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong>Feed your animals and reap the rewards! Feed your chicken a tomato, collect fresh eggs, and enjoy the fruits of your labor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147710/extras/8ba366275e2d3ed672f2876474fefe21.poster.avif?t=1749071241\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147710/extras/8ba366275e2d3ed672f2876474fefe21.webm?t=1749071241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147710/extras/8ba366275e2d3ed672f2876474fefe21.mp4?t=1749071241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Invest in Machines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your production by purchasing machines! Process your harvested goods to produce valuable items for your supermarket.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147710/extras/fcbec3284c7bdcbe05564a2d1795886c.poster.avif?t=1749071241\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147710/extras/fcbec3284c7bdcbe05564a2d1795886c.webm?t=1749071241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147710/extras/fcbec3284c7bdcbe05564a2d1795886c.mp4?t=1749071241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cashier</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quickly scan items, accept payments in cash or credit, and ensure your customers leave happy with their shopping experience!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147710/extras/69d284bb826c99a29b9c6b9578aae2fd.poster.avif?t=1749071241\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147710/extras/69d284bb826c99a29b9c6b9578aae2fd.webm?t=1749071241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147710/extras/69d284bb826c99a29b9c6b9578aae2fd.mp4?t=1749071241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><br>Work Smart</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quickly move your product crates to the market, fill the shelves, and meet your customers' demands!<strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147710/extras/704cb1bf3819e2accc9583a58467139f.poster.avif?t=1749071241\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147710/extras/704cb1bf3819e2accc9583a58467139f.webm?t=1749071241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147710/extras/704cb1bf3819e2accc9583a58467139f.mp4?t=1749071241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Supermarket Expansion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your supermarket with the money you earn! More space, more products, and more customers mean more sales. Strategically organize your shelves and highlight popular products.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147710/extras/9d36ee916c95c19b21644ae0de486d68.poster.avif?t=1749071241\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147710/extras/9d36ee916c95c19b21644ae0de486d68.webm?t=1749071241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147710/extras/9d36ee916c95c19b21644ae0de486d68.mp4?t=1749071241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offer the products you collect to customers in your supermarket. Build a loyal customer base by increasing customer satisfaction. Grow your supermarket by making strategic plans and attract more customers by offering the best service.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;This Prologue lets you produce and trade with the limited version of Farming &amp; Supermarket Simulator. Complete your fun Farming &amp; Supermarket experience by adding the full game to your wishlist!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow, Harvest, Use</h2></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the best use of your harvested products: either fill the supermarket shelves or use them as feed for your animals. The choice is yours!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147710/extras/712613ddd0613d6588c7d221a2dcafdb.poster.avif?t=1749071241\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147710/extras/712613ddd0613d6588c7d221a2dcafdb.webm?t=1749071241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147710/extras/712613ddd0613d6588c7d221a2dcafdb.mp4?t=1749071241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> <br> </strong>Feed and Collect</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong>Feed your animals and reap the rewards! Feed your chicken a tomato, collect fresh eggs, and enjoy the fruits of your labor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147710/extras/8ba366275e2d3ed672f2876474fefe21.poster.avif?t=1749071241\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147710/extras/8ba366275e2d3ed672f2876474fefe21.webm?t=1749071241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147710/extras/8ba366275e2d3ed672f2876474fefe21.mp4?t=1749071241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Invest in Machines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your production by purchasing machines! Process your harvested goods to produce valuable items for your supermarket.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147710/extras/fcbec3284c7bdcbe05564a2d1795886c.poster.avif?t=1749071241\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147710/extras/fcbec3284c7bdcbe05564a2d1795886c.webm?t=1749071241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147710/extras/fcbec3284c7bdcbe05564a2d1795886c.mp4?t=1749071241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cashier</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quickly scan items, accept payments in cash or credit, and ensure your customers leave happy with their shopping experience!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147710/extras/69d284bb826c99a29b9c6b9578aae2fd.poster.avif?t=1749071241\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147710/extras/69d284bb826c99a29b9c6b9578aae2fd.webm?t=1749071241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147710/extras/69d284bb826c99a29b9c6b9578aae2fd.mp4?t=1749071241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><br>Work Smart</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quickly move your product crates to the market, fill the shelves, and meet your customers' demands!<strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147710/extras/704cb1bf3819e2accc9583a58467139f.poster.avif?t=1749071241\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147710/extras/704cb1bf3819e2accc9583a58467139f.webm?t=1749071241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147710/extras/704cb1bf3819e2accc9583a58467139f.mp4?t=1749071241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Supermarket Expansion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your supermarket with the money you earn! More space, more products, and more customers mean more sales. Strategically organize your shelves and highlight popular products.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147710/extras/9d36ee916c95c19b21644ae0de486d68.poster.avif?t=1749071241\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147710/extras/9d36ee916c95c19b21644ae0de486d68.webm?t=1749071241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147710/extras/9d36ee916c95c19b21644ae0de486d68.mp4?t=1749071241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offer the products you collect to customers in your supermarket. Build a loyal customer base by increasing customer satisfaction. Grow your supermarket by making strategic plans and attract more customers by offering the best service.</p>",
